{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5000_situation", "source_sha256": "7683dc836f0030a01754ede8d303fbc2180493b41b0488b6a693c34584633d37", "ja": "学校紹介のレポーター", "zh": "学校介绍的播报员", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5000_place", "source_sha256": "36c5d7b28e2f5f6149d9269948883712223da1e2a92ee6189563ae2ff95fbaa2", "ja": "都内の学校", "zh": "东京都内的学校", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5001_p", "source_sha256": "3cbe4a25da9a6de136ec75f1994d29207e87e651877884940c6748287810020e", "ja": "（今日は、学校を紹介する番組の撮影。生徒への\nインタビューもスムーズに終わり、ロケは順調だ！）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄介绍学校的节目。对学生的采访也顺利结束，外景拍摄进展得很顺利！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5002_015siz", "source_sha256": "b25b8ac82d953b1c3fd6cb572ef45e00024fec12117c00290fed17269940b5d5", "ja": "学年ごとに雰囲気が違って、面白かったですね。\nインタビューしていて楽しかったです。", "zh": "每个年级的氛围都不太一样，挺有意思的呢。\n采访的时候也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5003_p", "source_sha256": "f00d8633f3585ed94410078a367553b3dfa3678323629ca5f2230b317dfb8146", "ja": "ああ、静香が同年代なのもよかったな。生徒たちの\n反応も自然だったし……ええと、次は学食か。", "zh": "啊，静香和他们同龄也挺好的。学生们的反应也很自然……嗯，接下来是学校食堂吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5004_015siz", "source_sha256": "2b08382233ee81af2916bf9ca3b09a6f70697b4dd75fe436368a0798ac642457", "ja": "はい。……実は、ちょっと気になってたんです。\n多くの生徒さんが、学食がオススメだって言ってて。", "zh": "是的……其实，我一直有点在意。\n很多学生都说，学校食堂很值得推荐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5005_p", "source_sha256": "35c9c859932b0eb08e0285f2f9451ab9b335004ed71cff2efc64953bd1822639", "ja": "資料にもそんなことが書いてあったな。\nメニューが豊富で、生徒や先生にも人気だとか。", "zh": "资料里也写着类似的内容来着。菜单很丰富，听说在学生和老师中都很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5006_015siz", "source_sha256": "bdfc9ec3b113f3c1126b95ba5ea5b425063bdc56810f4711e7744ae61b9ff555", "ja": "ええ。人気の定食が、2種類あるみたいで……。\n話を聞いてると、どちらも同じくらい人気らしいです。", "zh": "嗯。听说受欢迎的套餐有2种……  \n听下来，好像两边的人气都差不多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5007_015siz", "source_sha256": "411f7277f73217149c50e47cb2663ac57e19dbad41a77aa73d98102a8d2078b7", "ja": "{$P$}はどっちが気になりますか？\n……あくまでも、参考に聞かせてください！", "zh": "{$P$}对哪一种比较感兴趣呢？\n……请务必告诉我，就当作是个参考！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5008", "source_sha256": "36974ea249ef749c5178b3d793018b8005513fa4151fcb764973506d39a3f8b7", "ja": "日替わりワクワク定食", "zh": "每日更换的活力套餐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5009", "source_sha256": "0c4774a56572fe2ec42cfd8a469cc225afb7f2fdb5d07743cdddf3228c2bb23d", "ja": "びっくりモリモリ定食", "zh": "惊喜满满套餐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5200_p", "source_sha256": "a92645b5e46ec3e67b1d1bfd4b40b2ea3b180634f6424a9396a5667839e8f00e", "ja": "ここは、『日替わりワクワク定食』でいこう。\n一番スタンダードっぽいしな。", "zh": "这里就选“每日心跳定食”吧。\n感觉也最经典标准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5201_015siz", "source_sha256": "fae2b0257c5d4d476aa1008a5128f86c351b341d6a63987406abffffe38cd1cf", "ja": "そうですね。女子生徒からよく名前を聞いたかも。\n今日のおかずは、何でしょうね？　ええと……。", "zh": "是啊。我好像经常听女学生提起这个名字。今天的配菜会是什么呢？呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5202_015siz", "source_sha256": "3b3fa5fd985e29626e1307ee96a052d663665578adc94b34db94fa571f6d6f27", "ja": "『月見うどんといなり寿司』！？　私、コレにします！\n今日がうどんの日だなんて、これはもう……運命です！", "zh": "“月见乌冬面和稻荷寿司”！？我就要这个！\n今天居然是乌冬面日，这简直就是……命运！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5300_p", "source_sha256": "a92645b5e46ec3e67b1d1bfd4b40b2ea3b180634f6424a9396a5667839e8f00e", "ja": "ここは、『日替わりワクワク定食』でいこう。\n一番スタンダードっぽいしな。", "zh": "这里就选“每日心跳定食”吧。\n感觉也最经典标准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5301_015siz", "source_sha256": "e4d84077b90c117703806b9e87f0c2b9d7ed47679b595544b634a530533494f1", "ja": "確かに。日替わり定食って、\n色々と入ってて、お得だったりしますよね！", "zh": "确实。每日特价套餐里\n什么都有，挺划算的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5302_015siz", "source_sha256": "dfc2072c3daed197e7b3b7ed61d69009261023130cb2f52409aeb9c600c1990d", "ja": "あっ、でも、もし苦手なものが入ってたら……？\nううん、それも撮れ高か……よしっ、頑張ります！", "zh": "啊，不过，要是里面有不擅长吃的东西……？\n不对，那也能成为拍摄素材……好，努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5500_p", "source_sha256": "b412df77263ad6909bbbe0483a0fefdb1bbd2265d51e5413354391fb57f2cb8f", "ja": "『びっくりモリモリ定食』が気になるかな。\n名前からして凄そうだし。", "zh": "我对『惊奇大碗定食』挺在意的。\n光看名字就觉得很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5501_015siz", "source_sha256": "0c05c8dd2d2ca9d74334703c48c36e57037ff610756ea4d353f27acab0d91a85", "ja": "そっちは、男子生徒の一番人気みたいですね。\n特に運動部の生徒さんに人気があるとか。", "zh": "那个好像是男学生中最受欢迎的。\n听说尤其受参加体育社团的学生欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5502_015siz", "source_sha256": "8c22878629c9ca984626be8246d1e179107f4dbb40e8fbdf4c3b363bd834fa85", "ja": "人気ってことは、それだけ美味しいってことですよね？\nどんな定食か……楽しみですね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "受欢迎也就意味着特别好吃，对吧？\n真期待会是什么样的套餐……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5600_p", "source_sha256": "b412df77263ad6909bbbe0483a0fefdb1bbd2265d51e5413354391fb57f2cb8f", "ja": "『びっくりモリモリ定食』が気になるかな。\n名前からして凄そうだし。", "zh": "我对『惊奇大碗定食』挺在意的。\n光看名字就觉得很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5601_015siz", "source_sha256": "96d8a9c3a4c13a82552659515ba1e3c7cac136c934ede2cb0016f4e6805a5c86", "ja": "ネーミングは、私も気になりましたけど。\nもしかして、ものすごい山盛りなんじゃ……？", "zh": "这个名字我也挺在意的。\n难道说……分量多得堆成山一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_5602_015siz", "source_sha256": "cc9b9222a04c3e27f8ee7a742f282f926c41692e6863f7f7acb7b4f9749e6621", "ja": "私ひとりで食べきれない量だったら、\nその時は、責任をもって手伝ってくださいね！", "zh": "要是分量多到我一个人吃不完，到时候可要负起责任帮我一起吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
